# Drum Jam July 25th

It's that time again.. drumming and dancing at The Lane with Renae's Pantry crew and friends.There will be dinner, cake and chai. Bring your drum and leave your shopping until this afternoon where you can buy all of your good local fresh and pantry food from Renaes Pantry. This is beautiful relaxed family friendly environment where you and your family can come and grab a drum and join in on the fun. Be in the chance to win a FREE course with Rhythm Culture, a free t-shirt and a CD! All you have to do is come along and pop your email down. Join us for some good fun, great music and vibes on the last Saturday of every month! Yay! See you all July 25th!
